// SYNTHETIC fixture: every brand, person, handle, address and message below is invented
// (example.com / example.org / .test domains). No real email content, ever (Google API Limited
// Use: Gmail data is never kept as an eval set). Expand with more SYNTHETIC hard cases only.
// Format: one JSON object per line. label.category = TRUE category; label.is_deal optional
// (defaults to whether the true category is scoreable). // lines and blanks are ignored.
{"id":"seed-paid-1","from":"Dana Okafor <partnerships@peakform-apparel.example.com>","subject":"Peakform x you — paid ambassador program","body":"Hi Riley, I lead influencer partnerships at Peakform Apparel. We'd love to bring you on as a paid ambassador for our spring campaign — $2,500 for 3 Instagram posts plus a 6-month gifting allowance. Are you open to a quick call this week to talk terms?","label":{"category":"PAID","is_deal":true}}
{"id":"seed-media-1","from":"Marcus Lee <marcus@benchtalkpodcast.example.org>","subject":"Interview request — The Bench Talk Podcast","body":"Riley, I host The Bench Talk Podcast (top-50 in sports on the big platforms). We'd love to have you on to talk about your journey through the transfer portal. 45-minute remote recording, we handle everything. Would the week of the 21st work?","label":{"category":"MEDIA","is_deal":true}}
{"id":"seed-gift-1","from":"Nina at Lumawear <nina@lumawear.example.com>","subject":"Sending you some Lumawear pieces","body":"Hey Riley! Big fan of your content. I'd love to send you a few pieces from our new collection — no strings attached, just think you'd love them. Can you share your sizing and a shipping address?","label":{"category":"GIFTING","is_deal":true}}
{"id":"seed-fp-affiliate-1","from":"Creator Team <hello@creatorvault.example.com>","subject":"Partnership opportunity: monetize your audience","body":"Hi there! We partner with athletes to help you earn passive income. Join CreatorVault free, drop your affiliate link in your bio, and earn up to 30% commission on every referral. Thousands of creators already earning. Click here to apply and activate your account today!","label":{"category":"NOISE","is_deal":false}}
{"id":"seed-fp-growth-1","from":"Growth <team@boostlabs-media.example.com>","subject":"Let's grow your following 🚀","body":"We guarantee 10k+ real followers in 30 days for athletes like you. Our partnership packages start at $99/mo. Reply GROW and we'll set up your account. Limited spots this month!","label":{"category":"NOISE","is_deal":false}}
{"id":"seed-fp-saas-1","from":"Owen Park <owen@dealdesk-app.example.com>","subject":"A better link-in-bio for your brand deals","body":"Hey Riley, saw you're doing brand collabs — our tool helps athletes manage sponsorships and track deal revenue in one dashboard. Want a free 14-day trial? Happy to set you up. Book a demo here.","label":{"category":"NOISE","is_deal":false}}
{"id":"seed-fp-promo-1","from":"Strideline <news@e.strideline.example.com>","subject":"Members get 25% off — this weekend only","body":"Your exclusive member reward is here. Take 25% off full-price styles through Sunday. Shop the latest drops and refresh your training kit. Free shipping on orders over $50.","label":{"category":"NOISE","is_deal":false}}
{"id":"seed-fp-mlm-1","from":"Coach Kelsey <kelsey@thrivetogether.example.org>","subject":"Be your own boss 💪 join my team","body":"Hi girl! I'd love to have you on my wellness team. Set your own hours, get free product, and earn unlimited income sharing supplements you already love. Just a small starter kit to begin. DM me BOSS to learn more!","label":{"category":"NOISE","is_deal":false}}
{"id":"seed-fp-directory-1","from":"Editorial <submissions@risingathletesmag.example.com>","subject":"You've been selected to be featured","body":"Congratulations! Our editors selected you for our Rising Stars feature. To secure your placement and receive your digital feature package, the one-time publishing fee is $349. Reply to reserve your spot before it's gone.","label":{"category":"NOISE","is_deal":false}}
{"id":"seed-fan-1","from":"Jamie <jamie.fan14@mail.test>","subject":"You're my favorite player!!","body":"Hi Riley I'm 14 and I play midfield too, you're literally my inspiration. Can you follow me back?? I'd love a shoutout. Keep killing it!!","label":{"category":"FAN","is_deal":false}}
{"id":"seed-noise-newsletter-1","from":"The Daily Ledger <crew@dailyledger.example.org>","subject":"☕ The Fed's next move","body":"Good morning. Markets rallied yesterday as investors digested the latest inflation print. In today's edition: what the jobs report means, a startup you should know, and the meme stock that's back. Read on.","label":{"category":"NOISE","is_deal":false}}
{"id":"seed-schoolnil-1","from":"Compliance Office <nil@athletics.northfield-university.example.edu>","subject":"Action needed: disclose your NIL agreement","body":"Per NCAA and Northfield Athletics policy, please disclose the details of your recent NIL partnership within 7 days. Log in to the compliance portal to submit the brand, compensation, and deliverables. Reach out with questions.","label":{"category":"SCHOOL_NIL","is_deal":true}}
