{"id":"fp-fan-platform","from":"The Huddle Team <hello@huddlehq.example.com>","subject":"Exclusive Fan Community Opportunity for your superfans","body":"Hi Riley, we built Huddle — a platform where athletes like you can launch an exclusive community for your superfans and monetize your audience directly. Sign up free, claim your creator profile, and start earning from day one. Join thousands of athletes already on Huddle. Book a 15-min onboarding call to activate your account.","label":{"category":"NOISE","is_deal":false}}
{"id":"fp-bank-referral","from":"Northpeak Bank <no-reply@email.northpeakbank.example.com>","subject":"Get $400 when you open Northpeak Checking","body":"Your exclusive offer is here. Open a Northpeak Checking and Savings account, set up direct deposit, and get up to $400. Plus earn a competitive APY and pay no account fees. Open an account today — offer ends soon.","label":{"category":"NOISE","is_deal":false}}
{"id":"fp-restaurant-promo","from":"Casa Verde Grill <rewards@e.casaverdegrill.example.com>","subject":"Claim your free chips & salsa","body":"Your reward is waiting! Show this email in-app to claim free chips and salsa with any entree purchase this week. Not a member? Sign up for Casa Verde Rewards and earn points on every order. Terms apply.","label":{"category":"NOISE","is_deal":false}}
{"id":"fp-hotel-loyalty","from":"Harborline Stays <no-reply@harborline.example.com>","subject":"Earn 125,000 bonus points","body":"As a valued member, you're invited to earn 125,000 bonus points when you stay three nights before the end of the season. Enjoy complimentary elite status and member rates. Book your next getaway and start earning today.","label":{"category":"NOISE","is_deal":false}}
{"id":"fp-beauty-blast","from":"Glowmi PR <partnership@glowmi-global.example.com>","subject":"[Glowmi] @riley.athlete.test Seoul's #1 Hair Serum — free product for 1 TikTok","body":"Hello @riley.athlete.test! We are Glowmi, Seoul's #1 hair serum brand. We would love to send you our best-selling product for free in exchange for 1 TikTok video. You will also get your own discount code and earn 20% commission on every sale through your link. Reply YES with your address to join our creator program!","label":{"category":"NOISE","is_deal":false}}
{"id":"fp-agency-onboarding","from":"Summit Sports Agency <recruiting@summitsportsagency.example.com>","subject":"Pro Representation & NIL Opportunities","body":"Hi Riley, I'm a talent manager at Summit Sports Agency. We represent athletes and connect them with global brands for NIL deals. We'd love to add you to our roster and handle your partnerships for a 20% commission. No specific campaign yet — let's hop on a call to discuss representation. Are you looking for management?","label":{"category":"NOISE","is_deal":false}}
{"id":"fp-survey","from":"Insight Panel Network <invites@insightpanel.example.org>","subject":"Get compensated for your insight — 20 min survey","body":"You've been selected to participate in a compensated market research survey. Share your quick thoughts on athletic apparel and receive a $50 gift card. Limited spots available. Click here to confirm your eligibility and start the survey today.","label":{"category":"NOISE","is_deal":false}}
{"id":"fp-app-pitch","from":"Encore <founders@encore-app.example.com>","subject":"We built you something 👀","body":"Hey Riley! We're the founders of Encore, a new app that lets athletes drop exclusive content for their fans. We'd love to give you early access — claim your handle before someone else does. It takes 2 minutes to set up your page and start earning. Want us to send an invite link?","label":{"category":"NOISE","is_deal":false}}
// ── Recall guards: real deal shapes that MUST still surface, incl. agency-with-named-brand (synthetic) ──
{"id":"pos-jewelry-partnership","from":"Avery at Solstice Jewelry <avery@solsticejewelry.example.com>","subject":"Solstice x Riley — Sports Club Partnership Proposal","body":"Hi Riley, we're launching our Sports Club and would love you as a founding partner. The proposal: $3,500 cash plus product for 12 Instagram posts over three months, with an option to extend. Usage rights for 6 months. Can we set up a call this week to walk through the deliverables and timeline?","label":{"category":"PAID","is_deal":true}}
{"id":"pos-apparel-campaign","from":"Priya Shah <priya.shah@vantagesport.example.com>","subject":"Vantage Sport tournament campaign — paid opportunity","body":"Hi Riley, I'm on the Vantage Sport brand marketing team. We're building our tournament creator roster and would love to include you in a paid campaign — flat fee plus product, three social deliverables and one event appearance. Budget confirmed. Would you be open to discussing rates and timing?","label":{"category":"PAID","is_deal":true}}
{"id":"pos-agency-named-brand","from":"Jordan at Bright Lane Talent <jordan@brightlanetalent.example.com>","subject":"Hydrofuel campaign for you — paid","body":"Hi Riley, I manage brand partnerships at Bright Lane Talent. We have a confirmed paid Hydrofuel sports-drink campaign looking for collegiate athletes — $5,000 for two Instagram posts and a game-day story, shooting next month. We'd handle the contract. Are you available and interested? Happy to send the full brief.","label":{"category":"PAID","is_deal":true}}
