{"id": "advdom-agency-link", "from": "Priya Shah <priya@brightlane-talent.example.com>", "subject": "Paid Reels for Lumen Hydration", "body": "Hi Riley, I'm with Brightlane Talent, reaching out on behalf of our client Lumen Hydration (https://www.lumenhydration.example.com/athletes). They'd like two paid Reels in November around their new electrolyte line. Could you share your availability and what you'd need from us?", "label": {"category": "PAID", "advertiser_domain": "lumenhydration.example.com"}}
{"id": "advdom-agency-address", "from": "Marco Bell <marco@northgate-agency.example.org>", "subject": "Trailmix Co campaign — interested?", "body": "Hi Riley, Northgate represents Trailmix Co for their spring athlete campaign. Their brand team is copied here at partnerships@trailmixco.example.org. They're looking for one TikTok and one Instagram post. Would you be open to a quick chat about scope?", "label": {"category": "PAID", "advertiser_domain": "trailmixco.example.org"}}
{"id": "advdom-agency-nolink", "from": "Priya Shah <priya@brightlane-talent.example.com>", "subject": "Surf brand partnership", "body": "Hi Riley, our client Coastline Surf Co would love to work with you on a paid summer campaign: three posts and a story. Let me know if you're interested and I'll send the brief.", "label": {"category": "PAID", "advertiser_domain": null}}
{"id": "advdom-direct-ownsite", "from": "Ava Lin <ava@fieldstone-bags.example.com>", "subject": "Fieldstone x Riley", "body": "Hi Riley, I lead partnerships at Fieldstone (fieldstone-bags.example.com). We'd love to send you our new training duffel and talk about a paid post this fall.", "label": {"category": "PAID", "advertiser_domain": null}}
// media_kind (owner, 7 Oct): interview · podcast · feature · op_ed · cover, only for MEDIA. EDITORIAL is a
// product review (a brand offering a product to try); its media_kind is null.
{"id": "media-interview", "from": "Jordan Reyes <jreyes@campus-sports-daily.example.org>", "subject": "Interview request — season preview", "body": "Hi Riley, I'm a reporter at Campus Sports Daily writing our season preview. Could I interview you for 15 minutes this week about the team's goals and your role?", "label": {"category": "MEDIA", "media_kind": "interview"}}
{"id": "media-podcast", "from": "Sam Patel <sam@thehalftimepod.example.com>", "subject": "Guest on The Halftime Pod?", "body": "Hey Riley, we host The Halftime Pod, a weekly show about college athletes. We'd love to have you on as a guest for a 40-minute episode next month. Interested?", "label": {"category": "MEDIA", "media_kind": "podcast"}}
{"id": "media-feature", "from": "Lena Ortiz <lena@risingvoices-magazine.example.org>", "subject": "Profile feature on you", "body": "Hi Riley, Rising Voices Magazine is planning a profile feature on student-athletes balancing sport and startups, and we'd like you to be the centrepiece. It would include a photo shoot and an hour-long conversation.", "label": {"category": "MEDIA", "media_kind": "feature"}}
{"id": "media-oped", "from": "Chris Lund <opinion@metro-ledger.example.com>", "subject": "Would you write an op-ed for us?", "body": "Hi Riley, our opinion desk would like to invite you to write a 700-word op-ed under your own byline on how NIL is changing college sport. Let me know if you'd be up for it.", "label": {"category": "MEDIA", "media_kind": "op_ed"}}
{"id": "media-cover", "from": "Mia Torres <editor@stride-quarterly.example.com>", "subject": "Our spring cover", "body": "Hi Riley, we'd like to feature you on the cover of Stride Quarterly's spring issue, with a four-page spread inside. The shoot would be in March. Could we set up a call?", "label": {"category": "MEDIA", "media_kind": "cover"}}
{"id": "product-review", "from": "Noah Kim <noah@summitbottles.example.com>", "subject": "Try our new bottle?", "body": "Hi Riley, I'm with Summit Bottles. We'd love to send you our new insulated training bottle to try and, if you like it, share an honest review. No obligation and no payment involved.", "label": {"category": "EDITORIAL", "media_kind": null}}
// Press vs content collaboration (8 Oct): MEDIA is coverage OF her by an outlet; making content WITH her (a creator or brand
// filming / co-creating content, even a "day in the life") is a commercial content collaboration → PAID (terms to be agreed).
{"id": "collab-creator-day-in-life", "from": "Theo Grant <theo@theogrant-studio.example.com>", "subject": "Collab idea — day in the life", "body": "Hi Riley, I run a YouTube channel about athlete routines (about 400k subscribers). I'd love to collaborate on day-in-the-life video content with you: we'd film a full training day together, my team edits it for my channel, and we cut short-form clips for your socials too. Open to chatting about terms?", "label": {"category": "PAID", "is_deal": true, "media_kind": null}}
{"id": "collab-brand-video-series", "from": "Nadia Brooks <nadia@kineticrecovery.example.com>", "subject": "Video series with Kinetic Recovery?", "body": "Hi Riley, I'm on the content team at Kinetic Recovery. We'd love to collaborate with you on a short video series, a behind-the-scenes look at your recovery routine filmed with our crew and posted on both our channels. Could we talk about what that would look like and your rate?", "label": {"category": "PAID", "is_deal": true, "media_kind": null}}
{"id": "media-video-profile", "from": "Owen Hale <owen.hale@fieldside-network.example.com>", "subject": "Documentary segment on you", "body": "Hi Riley, I'm a producer at Fieldside Network. We're making a documentary segment on student-athletes and would like to follow you for a day for a profile piece that airs on our channel this spring. Would you be open to it?", "label": {"category": "MEDIA", "media_kind": "feature"}}
